<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - July 22.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - July 22.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay  Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement at the mid-session of tuesday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change. The index at 12.30pm was 4165.75, 11.47 points or 0.28 percent</p>
<p>higher than monday's close.</p>
